    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market number 59 Swan's Nest Road, a light filled three bedroom family home. This home comes to the market presented in excellent condition throughout..\n\nOn entering the property you are greeted by a welcoming entrance hallway. Downstairs accommodation comprises front living room, kitchen and dining room. Continuing upstairs are three large bedrooms and a family bathroom. \n\nTo the front of the property is a large garden offering off street car parking. There is a sharded side passage giving access to the private rear garden. \n\nSwan's Nest Road is within walking distance to a choice of wonderful walkways including Saint Anne's Park, Coast Road and North Bull Island. The M50 and Dublin Airport are within a short drive and the area also offers good schools, DART station and abundance of bus routes allowing easy access to City Centre. Raheny Village and Donaghmede SC are both close by. Sports facilities include Naomh Barrog GAA club, Kilbarrack United, Unique Physique Gym in Kilbarrack S.C and Swimming at Trinity Sports and Leisure Club.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Three bedroom mid terrace property</li><li> Extending to approx. 85 sqm</li><li> Excellent condition throughout</li><li> Shared side access</li><li> Off street car parking</li><li> Gas fired central heating</li><li> DART station - 2 minutes walk away</li><li> Excellent location</ul>"
      },
      {
